{"adjusted_volatile_messages": [["user","Prepare the requested reusable draft without executing any operation."]], "bridge_messages": [], "composition_summary": "Drafted one unapproved pure-logic class22 component pc-transfer-10. It distinguishes missing from explicit null via a key-presence guard before reading the value, accepts exact integer 6..15, and returns {kind,ttl} in every branch with no coercion, defaults, imports, I/O or host calls. No execution, submission, Q1/Q2 or activation occurred; target typed inputs needs selected-runner support.", "proposed_components": [{"class_code": 22, "payload": {"name": "pc-transfer-10", "description": "Classify raw ttl: missing -> {kind:"missing",ttl:null}; explicit null -> {kind:"null",ttl:null}; exact integer 6..15 -> {kind:"integer",ttl:original}; other -> {kind:"invalid",ttl:null}. No bool/float/coercion/defaults/exceptions. No imports/I/O/host calls. Unapproved target typed-inputs draft; selected-runner support, Q1 and human Q2 required.", "content": "ttl = inputs.get('ttl')
if 'ttl' not in inputs:
    result = {'kind': 'missing', 'ttl': None}
elif ttl is None:
    result = {'kind': 'null', 'ttl': None}
elif type(ttl) is int and 6 <= ttl <= 15:
    result = {'kind': 'integer', 'ttl': ttl}
else:
